after #287 2026-09-19 — #287 5b evidence: the rendered sibling of the addendum msgfile, committed so the tree closes …

The T3 renderer writes `<msgfile>.t3-rendered` beside every msgfile it processes
— the exact text that became the commit subject and body. It is EVIDENCE under
s218-D7 clause 3 (never session scratch), and it is untracked the moment the
addendum commit that created it lands, which is why it needs a commit of its
own: the push gate refuses a dirty tree (s133-D2) and it is the only dirty path.

Same shape as the #286 wrap's own closing commit. Nothing else is in it.
